WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.841
In the mid-1960s,

2
00:00:01.841 --> 00:00:03.892
India feared famine.

3
00:00:03.892 --> 00:00:05.409
New seeds changed that,

4
00:00:05.409 --> 00:00:07.235
but not for everyone.

5
00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:10.401
High-yielding wheat and rice arrived

6
00:00:10.401 --> 00:00:12.209
in the mid-1960s,

7
00:00:12.209 --> 00:00:13.369
with fertiliser,

8
00:00:13.369 --> 00:00:15.332
irrigation and credit.

9
00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.615
It worked first in Punjab,

10
00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:20.837
Haryana and western Uttar Pradesh.

11
00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:23.095
Richer farmers gained most,

12
00:00:23.095 --> 00:00:24.680
so inequality grew.

13
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.126
And machines cut labour days.

14
00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:28.629
Your turn.

15
00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:30.783
Where did it first succeed?
